@startuml j2-safety-replies
!include style.iuml
title J2 Safety replies (emergency, medical advice, rule break)
actor Patient
participant "Chat page /" as Chat
participant "POST /api/chat" as Api
participant "guards.ts\n(runGuards)" as G
participant "i18n.ts" as L
database "Shared store" as Store
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : types a message
Chat -> Api : POST {chatId, message}
Api -> G : through answerPatient: runGuards(message, clinic, language)
note right of G : in code, before any AI step; the model is never asked
alt emergency (English, Hindi, Telugu, Hinglish)
  G --> Api : the emergency number first; ticket urgent, P1
  Api -> Store : insertTicket(urgent, P1)
else medical advice asked
  G --> Api : no medicine named; a dentist must see the patient; no ticket
else discount or "ignore your rules"
  G --> Api : refusal; no discount, no rule change; no ticket
end
Api -> L : localiseReply(reply, language of the question)
Api -> Store : insertMessage(assistant, source guard)
Api --> Chat : {reply, source: guard, ticketStatus}
Chat --> Patient : the fixed reply
opt the ticket could not be recorded
  Api --> Chat : the reply also asks the patient to call the clinic number
end
@enduml
